### 4. VFX IMPLEMENTATION — Priority Logic & Systems

#### Execution Order Per Frame (Critical Path)
```
1. Process Input → Update Entity Positions
2. Detect Collisions → Queue VFX Events
3. Apply Hit-Stop (if queued): freeze time, skip to step 7
4. ParticleManager.update() — spawn bursts from collision queue
5. CameraController.update() — apply shake decay
6. MotionTrails.update() — record positions for fast objects
7. ShockwaveSystem.update() — expand/fade rings
8. FloatingText3D.update() — animate score popups
9. Render with EffectComposer
```

#### Camera Shake (`CameraController.js`)
```javascript
class CameraController {
  constructor(camera) {
    this.camera = camera;
    this.shakeIntensity = 0;
    this.shakeDuration = 0;
    this.targetPosition = new Vector3();
    this.currentOffset = new Vector3(0,0,0);
  }

  addShake(intensity, duration) {
    // Trauma accumulates — larger impacts override smaller ones
    if (intensity > this.shakeIntensity) {
      this.shakeIntensity = intensity;
      this.shakeDuration = duration;
    }
  }

  update(deltaTime) {
    if (this.shakeDuration > 0) {
      this.shakeDuration -= deltaTime;
      // Decay intensity exponentially
      this.shakeIntensity *= Math.pow(0.1, deltaTime);

      // Apply random offset within shake radius
      const x = (Math.random() - 0.5) * this.shakeIntensity * 2;
      const y = (Math.random() - 0.5) * this.shakeIntensity * 2;
      this.camera.position.addScalar(x, y);
    } else {
      // Smooth return to target
      this.camera.position.lerp(this.targetPosition, 0.1);
    }
  }
}
```

#### Hit-Stop System (`GameLoop.js` integration)
```javascript
class GameLoop {
  constructor() {
    this.timeScale = 1.0;
    this.hitStopRemaining = 0;
  }

  triggerHitStop(frames) {
    // Convert frames to seconds at 60fps
    this.hitStopRemaining = frames / 60;
    this.timeScale = 0; // freeze time
  }

  update(deltaTime) {
    if (this.hitStopRemaining > 0) {
      this.hitStopRemaining -= deltaTime;
      if (this.hitStopRemaining <= 0) {
        this.timeScale = 1.0; // resume normal speed
      }
      return 0; // pass zero delta to game logic
    }
    return deltaTime * this.timeScale;
  }
}
```

#### Particle Manager (`ParticleManager.js`) — Hard 500 Cap
```javascript
class ParticleManager {
  constructor(maxParticles = 500) {
    this.pool = new ObjectPool(Particle, maxParticles);
    this.activeParticles = [];
    this.maxCount = maxParticles;
  }

  spawnBurst(position, color, count, velocitySpread) {
    // Respect hard cap — drop oldest if over limit
    while (this.activeParticles.length >= this.maxCount) {
      const oldParticle = this.activeParticles.shift();
      this.pool.release(oldParticle);
    }

    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
      const particle = this.pool.acquire();
      particle.init(position, color, velocitySpread);
      this.activeParticles.push(particle);
    }
  }

  update(deltaTime) {
    // Update all active particles
    // Remove dead ones (lifetime ≤ 0) and return to pool
    this.activeParticles = this.activeParticles.filter(p => {
      p.update(deltaTime);
      if (p.isDead()) {
        this.pool.release(p);
        return false;
      }
      return true;
    });
  }
}
```

